 the `effective_number_of_speakers` to normalize energy coming from each channel). I don't feel that's especially relevant to a dev using the engine. Just knowing what happens when there are more channels, or fewer channels, than what the driver is expecting seems like the main thing to communicate here.","created_at":"2026-02-13T23:04:22Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T23:04:23Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105934#discussion_r2806438191","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105934","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2806438191"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105934#discussion_r2806438191"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105934"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2806438191/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":466,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2790446424,"author_association":"NONE","original_position":6,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2807441816","pull_request_review_id":3801748164,"id":2807441816,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6nVimY","diff_hunk":"@@ -224,6 +224,8 @@ class AudioServer : public Object {\n \tint channel_count = 0;\n \tint to_mix = 0;\n \n+\tint speaker_mode_config = -1;","path":"servers/audio/audio_server.h","commit_id":"b574e75951bf6cc330c76455fae38e884b5a3fdf","original_commit_id":"b574e75951bf6cc330c76455fae38e884b5a3fdf","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api