;","path":"servers/audio/audio_server.h","commit_id":"b574e75951bf6cc330c76455fae38e884b5a3fdf","original_commit_id":"b574e75951bf6cc330c76455fae38e884b5a3fdf","user":{"login":"BuzzLord","id":11238951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjM4OTUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11238951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord","html_url":"https://github.com/BuzzLord","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Because I offset it by one (compared the the `SpeakerMode` enum values), 0 is 'default', 1 is 'stereo', etc. I did this because I didn't like having the `speaker_mode_config` project setting have an enum start from -1, or have default take a higher value (like 4) that could theoretically change if speaker mode was refactored/expanded. 0 seems like a sensible default.\r\n\r\nIn `get_speaker_mode`, this is taken into account, to convert between `speaker_mode_config` and `SpeakerMode` enum.\r\n\r\nI changed this to 0 here because `GLOBAL_GET(\"audio/driver/speaker_mode_override\")` returns 0 as default during startup anyway, and both map to default in `get_speaker_mode`.\r\n\r\nRelated to this, the CLI argument starts at -1, and if its not set, will not change the `speaker_mode_config` that was set previously (i.e. from project settings). If it is set, then it will override the `speaker_mode_config`.","created_at":"2026-02-14T19:38:47Z","updated_at":"2026-02-14T19:38:47Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105934#discussion_r2807840865","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105934","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2807840865"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105934#discussion_r2807840865"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105934"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2807840865/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":228,"original_line":227,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2790417129,"author_association":"NONE","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]